vkintox uses the Google Sans and Material Symbols Rounded typefaces for its
interface.

Google Sans is distributed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
Material Symbols Rounded is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

the Material Symbols Rounded file here is a manually made subset of the full
font; the glyphs themselves are not modified.

the full license texts ship next to this note:
